# Fondue Monorepo Agents Guide

## Structure

- `builder/` — Fromager wheel building system
- `rhai-pipeline/` — Production package index / onboarding collections

## Commit Message Format

- Subject: `<TICKET>: <short description>`
- Body: explain what was done and why
- Use sign-off when required by subtree AGENTS.md

## Linting

Run `make linter` before committing. Fix all errors.
